Step 7:
Create a certificate chain ( if u have root & inter)
cat inter.cer root.cer > chain.cer

If only u have root then no need to create chain.


Step 8:
Create .p12

               [wasadmin@ee6cd08c9462 SSL]$ openssl pkcs12 -export -inkey mahesh.key -in api.mahesh.cer -name api.mahesh -out api.mahesh.p12
               Enter Export Password:
               Verifying - Enter Export Password:

Chain :   openssl pkcs12 -export -out certificate.p12 -inkey private.key -in server.crt -certfile chain.crt


Here name is alias & provide password.

