Step 10:
Convert.p12 into .jks

[wasadmin@ee6cd08c9462 SSL]$ keytool -importkeystore -srckeystore api.mahesh.p12 -srcstoretype PKCS12 -destkeystore api.mahesh.jks -deststoretype JKS

It will ak for password dest & source keystore (Enter the pasword >> jks will be created.)

